## Leaves
# 1. Creating leave

# --- IMPORTANT NOTES ---
# substituteTeachers: This field expects a JSON string mapping the exact date (YYYY-MM-DD) 
# to a specific class hour, which is then mapped to the substitute teacher's MongoDB Object ID.
# Example: '{"2026-03-10": {"1": "687f57b...", "2": "687f57c..."}, "2026-03-12": {"4": "687f57d..."}}'
#
# Terminal Formatting: Always wrap the substituteTeachers JSON in single quotes ('') 
# to prevent your terminal from misinterpreting the double quotes inside the JSON.
# 
# File Uploads: The supportDocument path MUST be prefixed with an '@' symbol.

curl -X POST http://localhost:2000/api/v1/createLeave \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_TOKEN>" \
  -F "category=<LEAVE_CATEGORY>" \
  -F "subject=<SUBJECT_LINE>" \
  -F "body=<LEAVE_DESCRIPTION>" \
  -F "startDate=<YYYY-MM-DD>" \
  -F "endDate=<YYYY-MM-DD>" \
  -F 'substituteTeachers={"<YYYY-MM-DD>": {"<HOUR>": "<TEACHER_OBJECT_ID>"}}' \
  -F "supportDocument=@<FULL_FILE_PATH_HERE>"

  
# 2. Fetching leaves
# The query string is optional. if the bearer token belongs to Princiapl, all leaves are fetched by default, howeer, if a HOD sends a request only leaves of that department will be returned. If a Staff makes the call only leave requests by that user will be returned
curl -X GET "http://localhost:2000/api/v1/get-all-leaves?departments=ECE" \
-H "Authorization: Bearer TOKEN"

# 3. Updating leave status 
# This call can be made only by a HOD or Principal
# i. Approving
curl -X POST "http://localhost:2000/api/v1/update-leave-status" \
-H "Authorization: Bearer TOKEN" \
-H "Content-Type: application/json" \
-d '{
  "leaveId": "6880c22936e6c74e4eefe6eb",
  "status": "Approved"
}'

# ii. Rejecting
curl -X POST "http://localhost:2000/api/v1/update-leave-status" -H "Authorization: Bearer TOKEN" -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"leaveId": "6880c16c36e6c74e4eefe6cd", "status": "Rejected", "rejectionReason": "Insufficient substitute coverage"}'

# 4. Fetching remaining leaves balance
# This fetches the user's current leave balances for all leave types.
curl -X GET "http://localhost:2000/api/v1/get-remaining-leaves" \
-H "Authorization: Bearer TOKEN"